# Run 394 evidence archive — only README.md, summary.txt, and .gitignore are tracked.
# All per-run artifacts contain absolute paths and ephemeral data and MUST NOT be committed.
# Captured --help text, logs, metrics dumps, node data dirs, snapshots, and any generated material
# are temporary and dev-only; only published-safe hashes and status lines appear in the tracked summary.
material/
node-data/
nodes/
snapshots/
logs/
data/
*.err
*.log
*.out
*.help.txt
*.kem.sk.bin
*.key
*.pem
metrics*.txt
